          "text": "Korende aye Omonene nomanyete omooroberio obo bw’okong’ita. Tobaisa kobaabera ebibe biabo, gose tobitinyia birue ase obosio bwao. Obatige babugwe ase obosio bwao, obakorere ayio ekero ore nendamwamu.”",
